# Terraform's state can hold sensitive values; it lives in a bucket, never in Git.
*.tfstate*
# Downloaded providers, recreated by `terraform init`.
.terraform/
# What Terraform writes if it crashes, for a bug report; never needed in Git.
crash.log
# .terraform.lock.hcl isn't ignored, on purpose: it's committed so every teammate and every plan
# uses the same provider builds.
